      "description": "Leading the modernization of legacy operational tools into scalable C# web applications and optimizing SQL-backed workflows to automate and streamline pricing operations.\n\n* System Modernization & Full-Stack Engineering\n* Modernized a legacy Access-driven workflow system by rebuilding it in ASP.NET with C# and SQL Server, implementing indexes and optimized stored procedures to cut page load times by 98% and automate 30% of Pricing & Product workflows.\n* Designed a MAUI + Blazor platform with a C# Web API (EF Core 9, SQL Server) to replace legacy WebForms apps, establishing integration patterns, server architecture, GitLab CI/CD, and an xUnit testing framework\n* Built high-volume CRUD and data-export features in ASP.NET WebForms, enabling validation and updates across 700K+ tasks/year and a 12.9M-record SQL dataset\n* Validated data entry grid structures and export processing pipes that could generate 2-million-row CSV files (split into batches of 500K) and helped cut the processing time of the quoted part by about 70%",
      "insights": "Bootstrap (Framework), Web Development and +18 skills"
