      "description": "Analyzed and created pricing structures using market trends, data cleaning, patterns, themes, and correlations for competitive margins.\n\n* Analyzed the SQL Server databases and margin models built in Excel to understand the price trends and optimized the logic used in the automated resale system to provide reliable and scalable results\n* Diagnosed and corrected packaging-related pricing inconsistencies through the review of SQL resale data that automated tools were missing in their margin break estimates and improved the margin break calculation logic by ~10%\n* Received CEO and Manager Excellence Certificate (2016) and Employee of the Year (2019)",
